```

Expected result:

**Auto Reply**

---

## UC-02: Urgent Customer Issue

```text
Customer submits urgent email
        |
        v
AI identifies high priority
        |
        v
Backend evaluates rules
        |
        +---- Safe to handle ----> Auto Reply
        |
        +---- Requires human ----> Escalate
```

Urgency alone does not automatically mean escalation; the final decision depends on the nature of the request.

